  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collective Action Driving Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program is a global capacity strengthening program, workning with civil society actors in five countries aiming at improving  livelihoods for excluded women and youth.  The objectives of the program is to: 
1) By 2030, a majority of IM&#x2019;s partners have improved their ability to support collective action, leading to better outcomes for targeted women and youth.
and; 
2) By 2030, CSOs in at least two of five countries report an increase in the share of flexible funding.</narrative>
  </description>
